  "description": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Seaguar BasiX, Strong, Soft and Smooth Casting, Premium, 100% Fluorocarbon Performance Fishing Line, Virtually Invisible, Value-Packed &amp; Budget Friendly</strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Seaguar BasiX is a soft, supple, easy-casting line that comes off a reel smoothly for a fret-free fishing experience. </span></p>\n<p><span>100% fluorocarbon; virtually invisible; made in Japan with cutting-edge innovation; with the knot strength and abrasion resistance you expect from Seaguar.</span></p>\n<p><span>BasiX delivers all the benefits of 100% fluorocarbon at a price everybody will love.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/6548/5531/files/Prop65-warning_v1_550.png?v=1780670842\" alt=\"\"></p>",
